<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62984" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piratical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.148
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστικῷ τρόπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					53.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστεία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				222c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span>, <i>piracy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>; <i>piratical vessels</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>in the manner of pirates</i>: 
				Comp.
			 -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώτερον, πλοῖα λ. παρεσκευας μένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.104
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστρικός</span>.</div>
